ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -15.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -15.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 &nbsp;일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -104.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금오인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학사정보</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설과목안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원스톱서비스 학부 개설과목 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -15.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -15.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">“2018</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">” </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강과목 변경신청서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일부터 학과사무실로 제출바람</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청기간 동안 본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호 관리를 철저히 하여 수강신청 시 불미한 경우가 없도록 주의하시기 바라며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">악의적인 의도로 타인의 아이디를 사용하여 신청 또는 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">삭제를 하는 경우 엄중히 처벌할 예정임</sp